-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A note on the raw data

The four CSV files in data/raw/ are public records of the State of Alaska,
redistributed here unmodified so that the package runs without any external
download:

  akfish-data-CFECpermits.csv
      Alaska Commercial Fisheries Entry Commission, permit and landings records
  employment-by-industry-community-and-year.csv
  employment-summary-data-by-community-and-year.csv
      Alaska Local and Regional Information (ALARI),
      Alaska Department of Labor and Workforce Development
  Total_pop.csv
      Alaska Department of Labor and Workforce Development, population estimates

If you reuse those files on their own, please cite the issuing agency.

